  questName: Hunt the Bone Mage
  description: "Intelligence confirms it \u2014 the Mage Skeleton is the one raising
    the undead army. Put an end to this once and for all. Take down the Bone Mage
    and free this land from darkness."
  objectives:
  - objectiveID: obj_03_kill_boss
    description: 'Defeat the Mage Skeleton '
