  turnInDialogueSteps:
  - Thank you so much, Hero! The Bone Mage has finally been defeated. Our village
    will be at peace again, thanks to you.
  - "I wish to bestow upon you the most precious treasure of the Sheriff family\u2014the
    Legendary Rake! Legend has it that it was forged from a meteorite and grants
    unparalleled power to those who are worthy."
